I've always found a ring of polymorph control (and a ring of polymorph
if you are exceptionally lucky) to be extraordinarily powerful items.
Many monsters have some unique abilities. Here's fun one: try polymorphing
into a trapper  (',').  If you hit any opponent, you swallow it whole.
Furthermore, you get 'food' credit for these kills.  Demons are fun too.
If you start getting beat, "help arrives," in the form of tame demons.
BTW, these tame demons will stay with you even after you stop polymorphing.

Unfortunately, I have had characters die from the shock of polymorphing.
Does anyone know a way around this?

-Bruce


